sn22.99:2.2 | S: In the same way, take an unlearned ordinary person who has not seen the noble ones, and is neither skilled nor trained in their teaching. They’ve not seen true persons, and are neither skilled nor trained in their teaching. | T: So too, the uninstructed worldling …
